'''Men''' are generic civilians of [[Gielinor]]. They can be found in most large cities and towns, especially those in [[Misthalin]], such as [[Lumbridge]], [[Falador]], and [[Varrock]]. While less common, they can also be found in remote areas such as the [[Wilderness]].

Men can be pickpocketed by [[members]] at level 1 [[Thieving]], yielding 8 experience points and 3 [[coins]]. They often drop low-level [[herb|herbs]] when killed on members-only servers. Talking to [[men]] gives a 1/128 chance of being offered a [[flyer]].{{CiteTwitter|author=Mod Ash|url=https://twitter.com/JagexAsh/status/987284477973065728|date=20 April 2018|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20200430123905/https://twitter.com/JagexAsh/status/987284477973065728|archivedate=30 April 2020|quote=1/64 chance drop from imps, 1/128 chance of being given one by talking to a generic man/woman, if that helps.}}

