==Trivia==
* One of the black clothed men next to the Silk Stall in Al Kharid does not have a "Talk-to" option. This may be used to train Thieving by hiding NPCs [[attack options]].
* Oddly enough, [[guards]] do not react to players killing these civilians.
* Most men had a festive override wearing a [[santa hat]] during the [[2023 Christmas event/Gallery|2023]], [[2024 Christmas event/Gallery|2024]], and [[2025 Christmas event/Gallery|2025]] Christmas events.

